@origin = https://localhost:7500
@schoolId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@branchId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@vehicleId = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333
@teacherId = 44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444
@operationId = 55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555
@userToken = REPLACE_WITH_AUTHORIZED_USER_TOKEN
@workloadToken = REPLACE_WITH_SCOPED_SCHEDULING_TOKEN

### Create inactive vehicle: 201; exact replay: 200. IDs and registration are synthetic.
POST {{origin}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: create-vehicle-example-01
Content-Type: application/json

{"branchId":"{{branchId}}","registrationCountryCode":"LT","registrationNumber":"SYNTHETIC123","manufacturer":"Synthetic","model":"Demo","manufactureYear":2020,"transmission":"Manual","categories":["B"]}

### Bounded page
GET {{origin}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/vehicles?limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Read vehicle
GET {{origin}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Replace descriptive fields; a stale revision returns 409
PATCH {{origin}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: update-vehicle-example-01
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":1,"registrationCountryCode":"LT","registrationNumber":"SYNTHETIC123","manufacturer":"Synthetic","model":"Updated","manufactureYear":2020,"transmission":"Automatic"}

### Replace categories while safely outside operation
PUT {{origin}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: replace-categories-example-01
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":2,"categories":["B","BE"]}

### Resolve and save the exact current Teacher membership
PUT {{origin}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/teacher-assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: replace-teachers-example-01
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":3,"teacherIds":["{{teacherId}}"]}

### Accepted Saga: 202 + Location. Disabled Scheduling: 503 before effects.
POST {{origin}}/api/v1/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/state-change-operations?schoolId={{schoolId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: activate-vehicle-example-01
Content-Type: application/json

{"operationType":"Reactivate","expectedVehicleRevision":4,"reason":"Planned activation after review"}

### Persisted operation status
GET {{origin}}/api/v1/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/state-change-operations/{{operationId}}?schoolId={{schoolId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Internal preflight: 200 can contain eligible=false. Reachable only through internal ingress.
GET {{origin}}/internal/v1/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/eligibility?schoolId={{schoolId}}&branchId={{branchId}}&teacherId={{teacherId}}&category=B
Authorization: Bearer {{workloadToken}}

### Missing required category collection: 400
POST {{origin}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: invalid-vehicle-example-01
Content-Type: application/json

{"branchId":"{{branchId}}"}

### Liveness and readiness
GET {{origin}}/health/live

### Own database schema, RLS and runtime role readiness
GET {{origin}}/health/ready
